{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237650/extras/DiscordEN.png?t=1747409130\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237650/extras/KickstarterEN.png?t=1747409130\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Get a taste of the <i>Nightmare Busters Rebirth</i> Experience!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the Kingdom of Dreams and discover the remastered and reimagined version of <i>Nightmare Busters</i>, the canceled Super Nintendo run'n gun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Journey through the Forest, take down the nightmares in your path, and leap from branch to branch! Will you be able to defeat the mini-boss duo, Goblinly &amp; Hootley?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience modernized gameplay with a secondary weapon and three superpowers to use wisely! Master arena battles, chain your moves for the highest combo, uncover hidden secrets, and aim for the coveted S++ rank!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Warning: the game is still in development\u2014some details may change in the final version!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3237650?t=1747409130","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237650/c5be6c304e7220d2895c6834e3ab9a6d1963184f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747409130","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237650/652af0a19352c44665e2764b0258f1015c06bf52/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747409130","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237650/652af0a19352c44665e2764b0258f1015c06bf52/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747409130","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237650/extras/DiscordEN.png?t=1747409130\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237650/extras/KickstarterEN.png?t=1747409130\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Get a taste of the <i>Nightmare Busters Rebirth</i> Experience!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the Kingdom of Dreams and discover the remastered and reimagined version of <i>Nightmare Busters</i>, the canceled Super Nintendo run'n gun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Journey through the Forest, take down the nightmares in your path, and leap from branch to branch! Will you be able to defeat the mini-boss duo, Goblinly &amp; Hootley?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience modernized gameplay with a secondary weapon and three superpowers to use wisely! Master arena battles, chain your moves for the highest combo, uncover hidden secrets, and aim for the coveted S++ rank!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Warning: the game is still in development\u2014some details may change in the final version!</strong></p>","developers":["Aurora Game Studio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3237630","name":"Nightmare Busters Rebirth"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237650/7ebbb4bcabbadf169f94387f7e4915c113d6cc3c/header.jpg?t=1747409130","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"Copyright Aurora Game Studio 2025<br />\r\nCopyright Pix'n Love Games 2025","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Nightmare Busters Rebirth - Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":[],"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Pix'n Love Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Vi